    <briefdescription>
<para>An Iterator adapter using an InnerInvGraphT::iterator as a base iterator, and storing the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1xray_1_1_graph_1aa7d4f1e9198ebd47ab0fc3cef797ac86" kindref="member">VertexIdentifier</ref> the iterator range comes from. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The dereference operator is then performed using a pointer to the graph&apos;s edge set. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
